---
// Betonarme metraj ve maliyet — hesaplar src/scripts/metraj-core.js içinde
---

<div class="sim-tab-panel" id="tab-beton" role="tabpanel">
    <p class="metraj-intro">Tipik bir kat planının ölçülerini girin; beton, kalıp ve donatı kat sayısıyla çarpılır. Kolon ve perdeler döşeme altındaki net yükseklikle, kirişler yalnızca döşeme altına sarkan kısımlarıyla hesaplanır; böylece döşeme ile çakışan hacim iki kez sayılmaz.</p>
    <div class="metraj-grid">
        <div class="metraj-controls-panel sim-glass-card">
            <h4 class="metraj-panel-title">Girdiler</h4>
            <div class="m-form">
                <fieldset class="m-group">
                    <legend>Bina</legend>
                    <label class="m-field">
                        <span class="m-label">Kat sayısı</span>
                        <span class="m-input-wrap"><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="1" step="1" value="5" class="sim-number-input" data-mmod="beton" data-mkey="katSayisi" /><span class="m-unit">kat</span></span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="m-field">
                        <span class="m-label">Tipik kat alanı</span>
                        <span class="m-input-wrap"><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="1" value="400" class="sim-number-input" data-mmod="beton" data-mkey="katAlani" /><span class="m-unit">m²</span></span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="m-field">
                        <span class="m-label">Kat yüksekliği (döşemeden döşemeye)</span>
                        <span class="m-input-wrap"><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="0.05" value="3.0" class="sim-number-input" data-mmod="beton" data-mkey="katYuksekligi" /><span class="m-unit">m</span></span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="m-field">
                        <span class="m-label">Döşeme kalınlığı</span>
                        <span class="m-input-wrap"><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="0.01" value="0.15" class="sim-number-input" data-mmod="beton" data-mkey="dosemeKalinligi" /><span class="m-unit">m</span></span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="m-field">
                        <span class="m-label">Döşeme kenar çevresi</span>
                        <span class="m-input-wrap"><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="1" value="85" class="sim-number-input" data-mmod="beton" data-mkey="dosemeCevresi" /><span class="m-unit">m</span></span>
                    </label>
                </fieldset>
                <fieldset class="m-group">
                    <legend>Kiriş, kolon, perde (kat başı)</legend>
                    <label class="m-field">
                        <span class="m-label">Kiriş toplam uzunluğu</span>
                        <span class="m-input-wrap"><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="1" value="160" class="sim-number-input" data-mmod="beton" data-mkey="kirisUzunlugu" /><span class="m-unit">m</span></span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="m-field">
                        <span class="m-label">Kiriş genişliği</span>
                        <span class="m-input-wrap"><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="0.05" value="0.25" class="sim-number-input" data-mmod="beton" data-mkey="kirisGenislik" /><span class="m-unit">m</span></span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="m-field">
                        <span class="m-label">Kiriş yüksekliği (döşeme dahil)</span>
                        <span class="m-input-wrap"><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="0.05" value="0.5" class="sim-number-input" data-mmod="beton" data-mkey="kirisYukseklik" /><span class="m-unit">m</span></span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="m-field">
                        <span class="m-label">Kolon adedi</span>
                        <span class="m-input-wrap"><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="1" value="20" class="sim-number-input" data-mmod="beton" data-mkey="kolonAdet" /><span class="m-unit">adet</span></span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="m-field">
                        <span class="m-label">Kolon kesiti b</span>
                        <span class="m-input-wrap"><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="0.05" value="0.3" class="sim-number-input" data-mmod="beton" data-mkey="kolonB" /><span class="m-unit">m</span></span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="m-field">
                        <span class="m-label">Kolon kesiti h</span>
                        <span class="m-input-wrap"><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="0.05" value="0.6" class="sim-number-input" data-mmod="beton" data-mkey="kolonH" /><span class="m-unit">m</span></span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="m-field">
                        <span class="m-label">Perde toplam uzunluğu</span>
                        <span class="m-input-wrap"><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="0.5" value="18" class="sim-number-input" data-mmod="beton" data-mkey="perdeUzunlugu" /><span class="m-unit">m</span></span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="m-field">
                        <span class="m-label">Perde kalınlığı</span>
                        <span class="m-input-wrap"><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="0.05" value="0.25" class="sim-number-input" data-mmod="beton" data-mkey="perdeKalinlik" /><span class="m-unit">m</span></span>
                    </label>
                </fieldset>
                <fieldset class="m-group">
                    <legend>Donatı ve fire</legend>
                    <label class="m-field">
                        <span class="m-label">Donatı oranı</span>
                        <span class="m-input-wrap"><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="5" value="110" class="sim-number-input" data-mmod="beton" data-mkey="donatiOrani" /><span class="m-unit">kg/m³</span></span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="m-field">
                        <span class="m-label">Beton firesi</span>
                        <span class="m-input-wrap"><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="0.5" value="2" class="sim-number-input" data-mmod="beton" data-mkey="fireBeton" /><span class="m-unit">%</span></span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="m-field">
                        <span class="m-label">Donatı firesi</span>
                        <span class="m-input-wrap"><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="0.5" value="4" class="sim-number-input" data-mmod="beton" data-mkey="fireDonati" /><span class="m-unit">%</span></span>
                    </label>
                </fieldset>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="metraj-table-panel sim-glass-card">
            <div class="metraj-table-header">
                <h4 class="metraj-panel-title">Betonarme metraj ve maliyet cetveli</h4>
                <div class="metraj-actions">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" data-metraj-csv="beton">CSV İndir</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm btn-open-report-modal" data-module="beton" data-table="table-beton">Rapor (PDF)</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="metraj-table-wrapper">
                <table class="metraj-table metraj-cost-table" id="table-beton">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th scope="col">Poz</th>
                            <th scope="col">İmalat</th>
                            <th scope="col">Miktar</th>
                            <th scope="col">Birim</th>
                            <th scope="col">Birim Fiyat (₺)</th>
                            <th scope="col">Tutar (₺)</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody data-metraj-body></tbody>
                    <tfoot>
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="5">Ara toplam (KDV hariç)</td>
                            <td data-metraj-sum>—</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tfoot>
                </table>
            </div>
            <p class="metraj-note">Birim fiyatlar örnek değerdir; hücreye tıklayıp kendi tedarikçi fiyatınızı girin. Girdiğiniz fiyatlar bu tarayıcıda saklanır ve tüm sekmelerde geçerlidir.</p>
            <h5 class="metraj-sub-title">Metraj dökümü</h5>
            <div class="metraj-breakdown" data-metraj-breakdown></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
